WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.936
-Oh, I got to give props
to the hair and makeup.

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.837
This is -- Explain this.
You posted this.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.806
-[ Chuckling ] Oh, yeah.
-Can you zoom in a little bit?

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.107
-Yeah.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:09.675
-So, explain what's happening
here, 'cause...

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:12.645
-Okay, so, Vivian Baker --
she's actually nominated

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.213
for an Academy Award
this year for "Bombshell."

00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:15.648
-Congrats, Vivian.
-She's amazing -- Vivian Baker.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.017
-Oh, yeah, it was great.
-So, she did

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.685
this really rough look,
because my family

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:21.120
has experienced
a lot of tragedy.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.855
-Yeah.
-And so, anyway,

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:24.557
she did this really rough look
at the beginning,

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.426
and this is once
I sort of clean up.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.994
But when I posted it,
people were saying,

00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:31.330
"Wow, Blake bravely show
what she looks like

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.366
before and after her makeup."

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:36.302
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:39.138
And...
-They -- They think you look...

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:40.807
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:43.810
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.879
They think this is what you
look like with no make up on?

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.781
Well, this is two sides.
-Yeah.

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:51.050
-This is -- This is
a partisan issue, here.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.685
-Yeah.
-There are two sides.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.021
Some people think that's what
I look like without makeup,

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:57.890
which I find very offensive,
because that takes an hour

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:59.726
for her to make
me look like that.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.895
This also takes an hour for her
to make me look this good.

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:04.830
So, like, I'm sort of like
vacillating

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.865
between, like, you know,
my vanity,

00:01:06.865 --> 00:01:08.801
which is, like, wanting to,
you know, be like,

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.136
"I don't actually
look like that,"

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.337
and then also, like,
being a feminist

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.039
and being like...
-"Why can't I?"

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:15.441
-..."Why do we expect women
to wake up looking like this?

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:17.744
This isn't realistic that you
wake up this beautiful."

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.545
-Sure.
-But I would like

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:21.247
people to believe
that I wake up that beautiful.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.216
[ Laughter ]
-If we're just being honest.

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:24.951
-Yeah, my feminism
sort of goes down.

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:26.552
-Come on, buddy,
it's not that crazy.

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:28.087
-Don't set unrealistic
expectations for women.

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:31.057
-But I saw that, and I go, "Oh,
my gosh, this is unbelievable."

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:32.358
-You're like,
"That's what she looks like

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:34.293
every time she comes over
with Franny."

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:36.596
-Every time I have a play date,
that's what she --

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.498
this is exactly
what you look like.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:40.166
She's like, [Rough voice] "Hey,
I'm droppin' my kids off."

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:42.302
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:43.836
"Hey, let yourself in
when you get back."

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:45.105
[ Normal voice ]
Kid's 5 years old.

